
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

    <title>Booking Successful - My Salon</title>

    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css">
</head>

<body>

<main class="auth-page">

    <section class="auth-card">

        <div style="text-align: center;">

            <div style="
                width: 70px;
                height: 70px;
                margin: 0 auto 20px;
                display: flex;
                align-items: center;
                justify-content: center;
                border-radius: 50%;
                background: #e8f4ec;
                color: #2e6b4a;
                font-size: 36px;
                font-weight: bold;
            ">
                ✓
            </div>

            <h1 class="auth-title">
                Booking Successful!
            </h1>

            <p class="auth-subtitle">
                Thank you for booking with My Salon.
                Your appointment has been received successfully.
            </p>

        </div>

        <div class="alert alert-success">
            <strong>Your booking has been submitted.</strong>
            <br>
            Our salon team will review your appointment and contact you
            with confirmation.
        </div>

        <div style="
            margin-top: 24px;
            display: grid;
            gap: 12px;
        ">

            <a href="/" class="btn btn-primary btn-block">
                Back to Home
            </a>

            <a href="/booking-status" class="btn btn-secondary btn-block">
                Check Booking Status
            </a>

        </div>

        <p class="auth-footer">
            We look forward to seeing you at My Salon.
        </p>

    </section>

</main>

</body>
</html>

